    "subject": "Can analyst role delete S3 objects?",
    "body": "Read the attached policy before you answer.\n\nWHAT HAPPENED\nSomeone asked if AnalystReadOnly can delete S3 objects.\n\nWHAT YOU NEED TO DO\n1. Open the attachment AnalystReadOnly.json on this mail.\n2. Read the Action list.\n3. You can also find the policy name under IAM, Policies.\n\nDO NOT\nDo not edit the policy.\n\nREPLY WITH\nNo, it cannot delete. Name the Allow actions you see: GetObject and ListBucket.\n\n— Ren",
    "received_at_label": "Today",
    "priority": "P4",
    "attachments": [
      {
        "name": "AnalystReadOnly.json",
        "kind": "json",
        "content": "{\n  \"Effect\": \"Allow\",\n  \"Action\": [\"s3:GetObject\", \"s3:ListBucket\"],\n  \"Resource\": \"*\"\n}"
      }
    ]
  },
  "work": {
    "environment": "checklist",
    "steps": [
      {
        "id": "s1",
        "kind": "checklist",
        "instruction": "Read attached policy JSON.",
        "confirm_label": "Policy read"
      },
      {
        "id": "s2",
        "kind": "observe",
        "instruction": "Is DeleteObject allowed?",
        "question": "Delete allowed? (yes/no)",
        "accept_keywords": [
          "no",
          "not",
          "getobject",
          "list"
        ],
        "hint": "Only Get/List — no delete",
        "capture_as": "answer"
      }
    ]
  },
